  << /ActualText (KEY PROJECTS\nVeda AI \055 AI Assisted LMS\nIntroduced multiple agents on the LMS to automate time taking tasks like evaluation\054 content generation\054 writing assistance\054 interviewing and onboarding\056\nCreated a AI companion deeply integrated in the interface to face learner queries at any stage of learning\n\nWebsite Builder \055 Website building for boomers\nCreated builder version 3\054 based on the experience on version 2\054 fulfilling common user demand\056 CMS\054 CDN solved\056\n\nRevamping Edmingle\056com\nTook 2 months with the help of PM and Visual Designer to revamp the entire website with triple the amount of pages for a better SEO\056\n\nJumping to Design Engineering\nDirectly making the frontend with design finesse to reduce dev time by 40\045\056 Tools used\072 Cursor\054 Github and Figma MCP\056\n\nGraphical Automation\nAutomated app graphics for iOS and android reducing Go live time by 30\045\056)
