713 0 obj
  << /ActualText (SUMMARY\nI\031m a Computer Science student turned Product Designer and Researcher with 4\053 years of experience dedicated to creating intuitive and emotional experiences\056 Jumping now to design engineering to add micro\055interactions and art to tech\056 Also\054 Architecture Dropout\056\n\nEXPERIENCE\nSenior Product Designer \055 Edmingle \nRedesigned the enterprise dashboard\050AI assisted\051\054 and the learner experience\054 boosting sales by 60\045\nIntroduced Design System 1\0560 to increase design efficiency by 40\045\056\nStreamlined navigation overall the main dashboard reducing user friction\n40\045 increase in adoption of new features through improved UX\056\nAutomated graphical dependencies on designers\054 saving 30\045 support time\056\nRevamped website for Edmingle 2026\n\nVisual and Product Designer \055 Zyncspace\nProduced branding and website for the new zyncspace\nShipped MVP\054 Website and Ads in limited time\n\nProduct Designer \055 Edmingle\nImproved main UX journeys reducing friction by 50\045\nImproved Bulk actions with CSV\050AI assisted\051 with a better UX\056\nCollaborated with Frontend \057 Backend engineering\054 support team as well as problem facing users to design within constraints\056\nRevamped Visual Identity and website for Edmingle 2024\n\nUI\057UX Designer \055 Europ Assistance\051 \nMoved the design process from Photoshop to Figma\056\nRevamped dashboards and introduced metrics for cyber security\056\nRevamped the entire website of Cyberior\056com)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 714 0 R
     /Pg 704 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
